<title>USA: Sun Prairie, Wis. won by Bankers Bank. [CORRECTED 20:45 GMT]</title>
<headline>Sun Prairie, Wis. won by Bankers Bank. [CORRECTED 20:45 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
